  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "My name is Tom. I am nine. I draw my family. It is a picture for school. This is my sister. Her name is Lily. She is seven. She has a big smile. This is my dad. He likes football.",
      "This is Grandma. This is Grandpa. They live in a small house. Grandpa likes fishing. Grandma likes flowers. They are old. This is Ann. She is my cousin. She is six. She is young. She has a red dress.",
      "Pip is in my picture too. He is a small brown dog. \"Is Pip a boy?\" asks Lily. \"Yes, he is,\" I say. Dad looks at my picture. \"Where is Mom?\" he asks. \"Oh dear!\" I say. I draw Mom with a big smile. Now my family is in the picture. We smile."
    ],
    "summary": "Tom draws a picture of his family for school. He tells us the name and age of each person, and he adds Mom at the end.",
